<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Telemundo cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Telemundo cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it downgraded Telemundo Group Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said expects Telemundo's prime-time audience share to decline to below 20 percent for the first quarter. This &quot;ratings erosion&quot;is worse than Salomon originally expected.</p>
<p>-- said &quot;it now appears that the ratings have continued to weaken and that any meaningful improvement will not occur until later in 1997 when new prime-time novelas will be launched.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Telemundo lost 5 to 21.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
